WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.011
Register your seller business. Open Create account and choose Sell on FabricTrad.

00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:10.022
Enter your business and contact details, GSTIN and the documents requested. Submit

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:15.034
the application and follow the verification status in your seller workspace. Complete

00:00:15.034 --> 00:00:20.045
missing information or respond to a review request. Listings and payments become

00:00:20.045 --> 00:00:25.056
available only after the required checks are complete.

00:00:26.056 --> 00:00:30.493
Connect your payout bank. In the seller dashboard, open Earnings, then Payout

00:00:30.493 --> 00:00:34.931
account. Enter your full bank number twice, IFSC, account holder name and

00:00:34.931 --> 00:00:39.368
the authorised representative's details. The full bank number from registration was not

00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:43.805
retained, so enter it again here. Accept the terms and submit to

00:00:43.805 --> 00:00:48.243
Razorpay. Refresh verification until Razorpay confirms activation; a manual admin review alone

00:00:48.243 --> 00:00:52.680
does not enable payouts.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.304
Understand your 90% share. For each new marketplace buyer payment, ninety percent

00:00:58.304 --> 00:01:02.928
is allocated to your Razorpay linked account and FabricTrad retains ten percent.

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:07.552
For example, a one thousand rupee payment allocates nine hundred rupees to

00:01:07.552 --> 00:01:12.176
you and one hundred rupees to FabricTrad. Payment processing costs and tax

00:01:12.176 --> 00:01:16.800
on FabricTrad's commission come from the platform share. Bank settlement follows Razorpay's

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:21.424
applicable schedule.

00:01:22.424 --> 00:01:26.635
Add products and variants. Open Upload or Add product. Enter an accurate

00:01:26.635 --> 00:01:30.846
product name, SKU, category, price, sale unit, stock and minimum quantity. Add

00:01:30.846 --> 00:01:35.058
clear product photographs and any supported product video. Give every colour variant

00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:39.269
its own matching photograph and available quantity. Save the product, complete any

00:01:39.269 --> 00:01:43.480
review required and use Inventory to keep stock current.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.989
Use seller WhatsApp uploads. WhatsApp product uploads are reserved for sellers. Use

00:01:48.989 --> 00:01:53.498
your registered seller number and the product format shown in the seller

00:01:53.498 --> 00:01:58.006
catalogue assistant. Include the product details and matching media, then review the

00:01:58.006 --> 00:02:02.515
resulting draft before publishing. This requires the seller WhatsApp service to be

00:02:02.515 --> 00:02:07.024
configured. WhatsApp is not currently a buyer shopping channel.

00:02:08.024 --> 00:02:12.016
Choose shipping for each order. In Orders, accept only quantities you can

00:02:12.016 --> 00:02:16.008
fulfil and wait for confirmed full payment before dispatch. Choose Shiprocket or

00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:20.000
another shipment provider for that specific order. For another provider, enter its

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.992
real name, the AWB number and a secure HTTPS tracking link for

00:02:23.992 --> 00:02:27.984
the buyer. Keep the shipment status and expected delivery date current. The

00:02:27.984 --> 00:02:31.976
provider choice is independent for every order.

00:02:32.976 --> 00:02:37.125
Check invoices and earnings. Use the order record to check the invoice

00:02:37.125 --> 00:02:41.275
and shipment details. Keep your legal seller name, address, GSTIN and product

00:02:41.275 --> 00:02:45.424
tax information correct. In Earnings, captured payments, refunds and seller allocations are

00:02:45.424 --> 00:02:49.573
shown separately. Transfer created does not mean paid to your bank. Processed

00:02:49.573 --> 00:02:53.723
means transferred to the linked account; bank settlement needs a separate provider

00:02:53.723 --> 00:02:57.872
confirmation.

00:02:58.872 --> 00:03:03.515
Keep your workspace up to date. Review notifications, customer questions and disputes

00:03:03.515 --> 00:03:08.157
regularly. Keep product availability, your pickup address and business contact information current.

00:03:08.157 --> 00:03:12.800
Use the website's language selector for your preferred interface language. If payout

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:17.443
verification needs clarification, correct the details or contact FabricTrad. Never mark an

00:03:17.443 --> 00:03:22.085
unpaid order as paid or a shipment as delivered before the records

00:03:22.085 --> 00:03:26.728
confirm it.
